# Web: Landing page FAQs (`PublicFaq`)

Marketing routes render `<PublicFaq … />` with SSR `faqItems` and matching `createPublicFaqSEOSchema` in `+page.server.ts`. Link copy uses `faqLink` / `publicFaqHref` (**web-seo-pseo** funnel for connect questions; **web-seo-cms-copy** for landing/pricing CMS).

## Three copy sources (do not mix patterns)

| Kind | Routes | Q&A source | IDs on items |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **CMS home FAQ** | `/` | Secret-admin `public_faq.ITEMS`; git fallback `PUBLIC_FAQ_ITEMS` via `resolvePublicFaqItemsVm` | CMS rows may omit `id`; defaults have `PublicFaqItemId` |
| **Pricing FAQ** | `/pricing` | `getPublicPricingFaqItems()` only — **not** full CMS list | From `PUBLIC_PRICING_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` |
| **pSEO / hub / detail** | Hubs, channels, agents, tools, API marketing, self-hosting, … | **Tailored** constants first, then **append** shared git-default rows | Appended rows always have `id` |

**Do not** replace tailored hub or channel FAQ arrays with only `getPublic*HubFaqItems()` — that drops page-specific questions. **Do not** duplicate full `PUBLIC_FAQ_ITEMS` on every hub.

## Single source of truth: `faq/index.ts`

| Export | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `PublicFaqItemId` | Stable kebab-case id for every git-default question |
| `PUBLIC_FAQ_ITEMS` | Full default catalog (`id`, `title`, `description`); seeds secret-admin defaults |
| `resolvePublicFaqItemsByIds(ids)` | Map ids → items (compare pairs, curated lists) |
| `appendPublicGeneralFaqItems(tailored, generalIds)` | Tailored first; append 2–3 shared items; skip duplicate `id` or **exact `title`** |
| `PUBLIC_*_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | Per-route general append set (see table below) |
| `getPublicPricingFaqItems()` | Pricing-only subset (`PUBLIC_PRICING_FAQ_ITEM_IDS`) |

Add or edit **global** Q&A copy once in `PUBLIC_FAQ_ITEMS`, assign a new `PublicFaqItemId`, then reference the id from pricing lists, hub append arrays, or `ComparePair.faqItemIds`.

### General append id sets (typical 3 each)

| Constant | Used on |
| --- | --- |
| `PUBLIC_CHANNELS_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/channels` hub, `getPublicChannelBySlug()` detail |
| `PUBLIC_AGENTS_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/agents` hub, MCP client landing getters |
| `PUBLIC_AGENT_HOST_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/agents/{slug}` host landings via `getPublicAgentHostBySlug()` |
| `PUBLIC_TOOLS_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/tools` hub, tool `build*FaqSection` helpers |
| `PUBLIC_COMPARE_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/compare` hub (`appendPublicGeneralFaqItems` on tailored hub copy) |
| `PUBLIC_CREATORS_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/creators` hub |
| `PUBLIC_ROADMAP_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/roadmap` hub |
| `PUBLIC_LISTINGS_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/playbooks`, `/building-blocks` hubs |
| `PUBLIC_SELF_HOSTING_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/self-hosting` (after operator-tailored block) |
| `PUBLIC_API_POSTING_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | Posting API hub |
| `PUBLIC_API_SCHEDULING_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | Scheduling API hub |
| `PUBLIC_API_PLATFORM_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `buildPublicApiPlatformFaqItems()` in `channels/api/_shared/shared.ts` |
| `PUBLIC_PRICING_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` | `/pricing` only — **no** `appendPublicGeneralFaqItems` |

Pick general ids that **do not** repeat a tailored question title (e.g. agents hub uses `try-free` instead of `agent-host-vs-mcp-billing` because the hub already asks how agent vs MCP billing works).

## Wiring patterns

### Hub config (`hubs/*.ts`, listings hub)

```ts
faqItems: appendPublicGeneralFaqItems(
  [
    { title: '…', description: `… ${faqLink(publicFaqHref.signUp, 'Sign up')} …` }
  ],
  PUBLIC_CHANNELS_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS
)
```

### Detail getters (avoid editing every channel file)

- `getPublicChannelBySlug()` — append `PUBLIC_CHANNELS_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS`
- `getPublicAgentHostBySlug()` — append `PUBLIC_AGENT_HOST_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` (no generic MCP primer; hosts cover MCP in tailored copy when relevant)
- `getPublicMcpLandingBySlug()` — append `PUBLIC_AGENTS_HUB_FAQ_ITEM_IDS`

### API platform pages

Tailored per-slug copy stays in `buildPublicApiPlatformFaqItems()`; return `appendPublicGeneralFaqItems(tailored, PUBLIC_API_PLATFORM_FAQ_ITEM_IDS)`.

### Compare head-to-head

`buildComparePair()` sets `faqItemIds` (defaults: switch / trial / multi-workspace). Presenter uses `resolvePublicFaqItemsByIds` — no tailored block unless you extend `ComparePair`.

### Home (`/`)

- Server: `parsePublicFaqConfigModule` → `resolvePublicFaqItemsVm(parsed)` for JSON-LD
- Client: `resolvePublicFaqItemsVm(data.publicFaqItemsVm)` in `+page.svelte`
- Empty CMS → full `PUBLIC_FAQ_ITEMS`

### Pricing (`/pricing`)

- `getPublicPricingFaqItems()` in `+page.server.ts` for accordion + schema
- FAQ **headers** from `public_faq` config only (**web-seo-cms-copy**)

### `PublicFaq.svelte`

If `faqItems` is empty, component falls back to `[...PUBLIC_FAQ_ITEMS]` — routes should pass explicit lists in production.

## SEO and admin

- Visible accordion and `createPublicFaqSEOSchema({ items })` must use the **same** `faqItems` array from the server load.
- After changing `PUBLIC_FAQ_ITEMS` defaults, re-save **Public FAQ** in secret-admin (or clear `ITEMS`) so production CMS matches git (**web-seo-cms-copy**).
- Channel connect funnel and self-host anchor rules: **web-seo-pseo** (not duplicated here).

