## PR checklist (FAQ touch)

- [ ] New global question: `PublicFaqItemId` + row in `PUBLIC_FAQ_ITEMS` with `faqLink` / `publicFaqHref`
- [ ] Hub or detail: tailored array **unchanged in intent** + `appendPublicGeneralFaqItems(..., PUBLIC_*_FAQ_ITEM_IDS)` (or getter that appends)
- [ ] Pricing-only topics: add id to `PUBLIC_PRICING_FAQ_ITEM_IDS` if `/pricing` should show it
- [ ] No duplicate titles between tailored and appended general rows
- [ ] `+page.server.ts` schema uses same items as `<PublicFaq faqItems={…} />`
- [ ] Tests updated for new hub or id set

